# Orchestrator runtime state: lock, resumable session ids, per-cycle JSON logs and the
# usage ledger. Machine-local and rewritten constantly — committing it would make every
# cycle conflict with the laptop on `git pull`.
.orchestrator/

# Generated every cycle from AGENTS.md + PLAN.md + STATUS.md; never hand-edited, so
# there's nothing to preserve in git.
ideas/*/CLAUDE.md

# Never commit the shared heartbeat secret or the box's auth token.
*.env
orchestrator/env
